## Outcome

- What is different when this is done, in terms a stakeholder would use.
- Not a list of tasks. If you cannot state the outcome without describing the
  implementation, the epic is not yet understood.

## Boundaries

What this explicitly does not cover. The most useful line in the document, because
it is the one that stops scope arriving later disguised as a clarification.

## Specs

Slices of this epic, each small enough to finish. Every `SPEC-*.md` that names this
epic in its frontmatter belongs here; `ilk check` verifies the reference resolves.
